"存储读写失败返回 HTTP 503 storage_unavailable，本次清理不能留下部分删除结果" — DeleteInstances is transactional; on commit failure, rollback. Good.

Also — should cleanup reject when body is not a JSON object? buildParamBag already returns 400 "request body must be a JSON object" for malformed JSON. Good.

Now let me also check the NoRoute handler — `/api/v1/cleanup` is a POST route, registered explicitly, so no NoRoute concerns.

