Now, about the README documentation: The README documents every public entry. I should add a section for the cleanup endpoint. The README has a truncated part in my reading — let me read the full README to find where to add documentation. Let me view the sections around discovery and overview.

Also tests: I should add a cleanup_test.go following the existing test conventions. Let me look at the rest of discovery_test.go to see conventions for storage-unavailable tests etc. I've seen enough patterns from services_overview_test.go.

